'''Junkrat''' is a [[Sub-Roles#Specialist|Specialist]] [[Roles#Damage|Damage]] [[Heroes|hero]] in ''[[Overwatch 2|Overwatch]]''. He is one of the 21 heroes included in the game's release on 24 May 2016.

==Overview==
[[File:Junkrat HS.mp4|left|thumb]] Junkrat's area-denying armaments include a Frag Launcher that lobs bouncing grenades, Concussion Mines that send enemies flying, and Steel Traps that stop foes dead in their tracks.

